        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-6$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3^{2x}&=3^{3(x+2)}\\\\2x&=3(x+2)\\\\2x&=3x+6\\\\-x&=6\\\\x&=-6\\end{align*}$$",
