        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=3$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2^{4(x+2)}&=2^{5(x+1)}\\\\4(x+2)&=5(x+1)\\\\4x+8&=5x+5\\\\3&=x\\\\x&=3\\end{align*}$$",
